  <div class="about-page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      I write here to untangle things that feel too slow or awkward for social feeds.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most of it gets written late at night—switching between English and Bahasa Indonesia—picking at whatever stuck with me during the day: why running gear got weirdly stressful, how old water pipes hold a city together, or the quiet sociology of a roadside coffee stall at 2 AM.
    </p>

    <p>
      No grand theories or advice. Just writing things down to see if they hold up once they're out of my head.
    </p>

    <h2>Colophon</h2>

    <p>
      Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a>, static HTML/CSS, and set in <em>IBM Plex Mono</em>. No tracking, ads, or cookies.
    </p>

    <p>
      New pieces go to <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
